.live/docker-output
# `lab/`, `tests/` and `scripts/` are deliberately kept: the lab recipe (`Dockerfile`) does an
# unqualified `COPY . .` and builds them. Nothing in either image reads `.sdd` or the golden e2e
# case fixtures (screenshots, only `test:e2e` and the test suite read them).
